#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_31
msgid ""
"Some painters transform the sun into a yellow spot, others transform a "
"yellow spot into the sun."
msgstr ""
"Certains peintres transforment le soleil en un point jaune, d'autres "
"transforment un point jaune en soleil."

#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_104
msgid ""
"Speech is silver, but silence is golden... except in the face of injustice."
msgstr ""
"La parole est d'argent, mais le silence est d'or... sauf face à l'injustice."

#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,author:daily_todo_digest.quote_70
