#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_78
msgid ""
"Strength does not come from physical capacity. It comes from an indomitable "
"will."
msgstr ""
"La force ne vient pas des capacités physiques, elle vient d'une volonté "
"indomptable."

