#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_59
msgid "What does not kill me makes me stronger... but first, it really hurts."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui ne me tue pas me rend plus fort... mais d'abord, ça fait vraiment "
"mal."

#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_109
msgid ""
"When education is not liberating, the dream of the oppressed is to become "
"the oppressor."
msgstr ""
"Quand l'éducation n'est pas libératrice, le rêve de l'opprimé est de devenir"
" l'oppresseur."

#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_64
msgid ""
"When the last tree has been cut down, the last river poisoned and the last "
"fish caught, only then will you realise that money cannot be eaten."
msgstr ""
"Quand le dernier arbre sera abattu, la dernière rivière empoisonnée, le "
"dernier poisson capturé, alors seulement vous réaliserez que l'argent ne se "
"mange pas."

#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_45
msgid ""
"When they came for the communists, I said nothing; I was not a communist..."
msgstr ""
"Quand ils sont venus chercher les communistes, je n'ai rien dit, je n'étais "
"pas communiste..."

#. module: daily_todo_digest
#: model:daily.digest.quote,quote:daily_todo_digest.quote_103
msgid ""
"Whoever asks a question looks foolish for five minutes; whoever does not "
"stays foolish for life."
msgstr ""
"Celui qui pose une question est bête cinq minutes, celui qui n'en pose pas "
"le reste toute sa vie."

